42 0 obj
<<
  /Type /StructElem
  /S /Figure
  /P 41 0 R
  /Alt (Three-layer architecture diagram showing the standards landscape for gaze-aware voice agents. Top layer labeled Applications in green contains Conversational Interfaces, Assistive Technology, and Interactive Systems. Middle layer labeled Voice Agent Standards in blue contains Speech Recognition, Dialog Management, plus two proposed standards shown with dashed orange borders: Gaze Events and Multimodal Fusion. Bottom layer labeled Browser APIs in gray contains WebRTC, Media Capture, DOM and Accessibility Tree as existing standards, plus a proposed Gaze Tracking API shown with dashed orange border. Bidirectional arrows connect the layers indicating integration between levels. Legend distinguishes existing standards with solid gray borders from proposed standards with dashed orange borders.)
  /A [<<
    /O /Layout
    /Placement /Block
    /BBox [430.9449 51.414642 835.612 375.14835]
  >>]
  /K [26]
  /Pg 442 0 R
>>
endobj

